[I] Utilities to configure the MATE desktop

[T] The control center is MATE's main interface for configuration of various
[T] aspects of your desktop.

[U] https://mate-desktop.org/

[A] MATE developer
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/desktop/mate

[E] add mate-panel

[L] GPL
[V] 1.29.1

[D] b747924f7dab46ded423b91074a8a693f0e899abb1223fb7d71801a7 mate-control-center-1.29.1.tar.gz https://github.com/mate-desktop/mate-control-center/archive/refs/tags/v1.29.1/

. $base/package/*/*/mate-conf.in

pkginstalled accountsservice || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Daccountsservice=disabled
pkginstalled libayatana-appindicator || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dlibappindicator=disabled
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -L$root$(pkgprefix libdir glib)
